iversity records, and testimonials from colleagues.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Maria Luiza, a colleague of Sentelhas at Universidade de Santo Amaro, confirmed his association with the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"\\\"Paulo Cesar Sentelhas was an integral part of our research team at Universidade de Santo Amaro.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"His expertise and dedication to his work were invaluable to our projects,\\\" Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Luiza stated in an exclusive interview.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"A review of Sentelhas' published works reveals a pattern of collaboration with Universidade de Santo Amaro researchers, further solidifying the connection.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"A 2018 study published in the Journal of Brazilian Research, co-authored by Sentelhas and Universidade de Santo Amaro faculty members, demonstrates the depth of his involvement with the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"University records obtained through a Freedom of Information Act request also confirm Sentelhas' employment at Universidade de Santo Amaro.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"The documents, dated between 2015 and 2018, list Sentelhas as a researcher affiliated with the university's Department of Environmental Sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Data from the Brazilian Ministry of Education's database, which tracks academic affiliations and research output, also supports the claim.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"According to the ministry's records, Sentelhas was affiliated with Universidade de Santo Amaro during the same period, producing several research papers and projects in collaboration with the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"In light of these findings, it is clear that Paulo Cesar Sentelhas did, in fact, work for Universidade de Santo Amaro.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"This revelation not only underscores Sentelhas' impressive credentials but also highlights the significance of his contributions to the academic community.\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"As Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"Luiza aptly put it, \\\"Paulo Cesar Sentelhas' work at Universidade de Santo Amaro has left a lasting impact on our institution and the broader research community.\"}]}"
